### 経費精算承認サンプル API
### ローカル起動時は 8080、docker compose 起動時は 18080
@host = http://localhost:8080
@applicant = yamada:password
@manager = sato:password
@director = tanaka:password

### 1. 申請（5万円 → 課長ルート）
POST {{host}}/api/expense-requests
Authorization: Basic {{applicant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "9月出張旅費",
  "amount": 50000,
  "expenseDate": "2026-08-18",
  "category": "旅費交通費",
  "remarks": "新幹線往復"
}

### 2. 申請（15万円 → 部長ルート）
POST {{host}}/api/expense-requests
Authorization: Basic {{applicant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "海外出張旅費",
  "amount": 150000,
  "expenseDate": "2026-08-10",
  "category": "旅費交通費"
}

### 3. 自分の申請一覧
GET {{host}}/api/expense-requests
Authorization: Basic {{applicant}}

### 4. 申請の状態
GET {{host}}/api/expense-requests/{{processInstanceId}}
Authorization: Basic {{applicant}}

### 5. 課長の承認タスク一覧
GET {{host}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Basic {{manager}}

### 6. 部長の承認タスク一覧
GET {{host}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Basic {{director}}

### 7. 承認
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/approve
Authorization: Basic {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "問題ありません"
}

### 8. 却下（コメント必須）
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/reject
Authorization: Basic {{director}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "見積根拠が不足しています"
}

### 9. リマインドを3日待たずに発火（動作確認用）
POST {{host}}/api/demo/reminders/{{processInstanceId}}
Authorization: Basic {{manager}}

### 10. ヘルスチェック
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
